OL,3,GNEWSAA deadly secret in the Thames -
OL,4,Awhat is the SS Richard Montgomery?
OL,5,
OL,6,FShipwrecked in the Thames Estuary lies
OL,7,Fa boat packed with 1,400 tonnes of
OL,8,Fexplosives that could blow at any
OL,9,Fpoint.
OL,11,FIt is a story that has captivated
OL,12,Fgenerations since the SS Richard
OL,13,FMontgomery sank in 1944 during World
OL,14,FWar Two.
OL,16,FSome believe a blast would wipe out
OL,17,Fparts of the Essex and Kent coastlines,
OL,18,Fwhile others say it would be nothing
OL,19,Fmore than a "damp squib".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
